# The contact sheet exists so a person can LOOK at the pictures, so it carries image urls for
# every post it lists. This repository is public; the urls are not committed and the sheet is
# regenerated locally with:
#
#     python scripts/inquiry_intelligence_rehearsal.py --propose-architecture
#
# `candidates.json` IS committed — it carries post ids and cluster sizes and no urls.
architecture-control/contact-sheet.md

# Run archives accumulate per run and can carry a live session verbatim. One worked example is
# committed under runs/baseline-rev6/; everything else stays local until somebody chooses to add it.
run-archive/*
!run-archive/README.md
!run-archive/baseline-rev6/
!run-archive/baseline-rev6/**
